"{{Term/Store|Koko Cuisine||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Koko Cuisine}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Kakariko Village}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

==Overview==
[[Link]]'s help with [[Koko]]'s last [[Side Quest]], "[[Cooking with Koko]]" opens up this next problem. Once he speaks to her at the [[Cooking Pot]], Koko decides to make her father [[Dorian]]'s favorite dish, [[Tough Meat-Stuffed Pumpkin]].<ref>{{Cite|What should Koko make now... {{Big|OH!}} Koko will make Father's favorite! {{Color BotW|Blue|Tough meat-stuffed pumpkin}}!|Koko|BotW}}</ref> However, when she goes over her ingredients, she realizes she is missing [[Raw Meat]].<ref>{{Cite|Let's see... The ingredients are... {{Color BotW|Blue|fortified pumpkin}} and {{Color BotW|Blue|raw meat}}. Hrm? ...{{Color BotW|Blue|Raw meat}}? {{Big|OH, NO!!}} Koko is out of {{Color BotW|Blue|raw meat}}...|Koko|BotW}}</ref> Though using a different type of meat is an option, her mother's recipe specifically calls for Raw Meat.<ref>{{Cite|Koko could use a different kind of meat, but...without {{Color BotW|Blue|raw meat}}, Koko can't re-create Mother's recipe...|Koko|BotW}}</ref> Since Dorian has been working so much lately, he has not been able to hunt for Raw Meat for his family.<ref>{{Cite|Father used to go hunting to make sure we always had {{Color BotW|Blue|raw meat}}. But he's at work right now...|Koko|BotW}}</ref>

Koko becomes sad, saying she is a bad daughter who can not do anything right and can never be like her mother.<ref>{{Cite|Koko is a bad daughter who can't do anything right. Koko will never be like Mother...|Koko|BotW}}</ref> Should Link comfort her instead of offering assistance, Koko will sink further into a self-imposed depression.<ref>{{Cite|[Cheer up!] Without {{Color BotW|Blue|raw meat}}... Koko feels so empty...|Koko|BotW}}</ref> However, if Link offers her Raw Meat without any his [[Inventory]], Koko will be able to tell he is lying.<ref>{{Cite|[Voilà! Raw meat!] Koko knows when someone is lying. Father isn't good at lying either...|Koko|BotW}}</ref> When she finishes talking to Link, the Side Quest begins.

Raw Meat is dropped by three different types of [[Creature]]s, those being [[Woodland Boar]]s, [[Mountain Goat]]s, and [[Grassland Fox]]es. There is also a [[Merchant]] who travels near the [[Dueling Peaks]], [[Mezer]], who sells Raw Meats.

When spoken to again, Koko is busy beating herself up for forgetting another important ingredient.<ref>{{Cite|ARGH! Koko wants to cook {{Color BotW|Blue|tough meat-stuffed pumpkin}} but forgot the {{Color BotW|Blue|raw meat}}?!|Koko|BotW}}</ref> Once Link offers her Raw Meat, Koko makes sure he is alright with her taking it. Afterwards, she begins to [[Cooking|Cook]] and asks Link to wait.<ref>{{Cite|Is this...{{Big|raw meat?!}} Are you sure about this? Really? Thank you so much! Koko means it! Stay right there for a second!|Koko|BotW}}</ref>

Koko is pleased with the result and offers Link some of the [[Meal]] as a reward.<ref>{{Cite|Mmm! What a scrumptious smell! Oh, and that savory meat pairs SO well with the sweetness of the pumpkin! This is just how Mother made it! Here, have some! It's so good!|Koko|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|If Link's [[Food]] [[Inventory]] is full, Koko will ask him to clear out space before giving him the Meal.<ref>{{Cite|Huh? Your pouch is full! But Koko can't give you any food if you don't have room for it! Koko worked so hard to make it. Koko wanted to thank you...|Koko|BotW}}</ref>}} Koko declares that she will continue to improve, ending the Side Quest.<ref>{{Cite|Koko will work hard to get better and better at cooking!|Koko|BotW}}</ref>

